  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Laos Australia Institute Phase 3 is a human resource development(HRD) program which incorporates: Australia Awards long term scholarships and short term awards and trainings; HRD support and technical assistance to the Lao government; alumni engagement activities; support for GEDSI, research,  communications and public diplomacy activities.</narrative>
